{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2012510/extras/Vanguard_Featured_30_616x225_V4.gif?t=1746726495\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plunge into the heart of battle as the ultimate battlefield commander fighting for survival in a science fantasy universe, where Earth\u2019s fate hangs on the edge of oblivion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Human defenders and their faithful robot allies stand defiant against two warring alien factions: a race of warlike demonic invaders and their technologically advanced angelic rivals. Together, these three are locked in a relentless struggle for dominance. <i>Stormgate </i>puts you\u00a0 in command of futuristic armies in  epic real-time strategy battles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2012510/extras/EA_ArmiesCollide_fixed_30_616x225.gif?t=1746726495\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fight for the Future</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the ultimate test of strategic warfare with three highly-asymmetric factions: the stalwart Human Vanguard, the relentless Infernal Host, or the highly-advanced Celestial Armada. Team up with friends and command legendary Heroes to conquer the challenging AI in co-op mode, or test your mettle on the global stage in a hero-free competitive ranked ladder focused purely on player skill. Get ready for an innovative 3v3 mode, currently in development, with a no-elimination policy to ensure you always taste victory or defeat together, as a unified team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2012510/extras/EA_MalocUltimate_30_616x225.gif?t=1746726495\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Next Generation RTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Stormgate</i> takes RTS gaming to new heights by harnessing the power of Unreal Engine 5, supercharged by our proprietary SnowPlay technology. This combination delivers an unparalleled responsive RTS gameplay experience. Our use of globally distributed servers aims to connect players from around the world, supported by advanced Rollback technology for silky smooth and stutter-free gameplay. This combination of cutting-edge technology and ultra-modern infrastructure mean you can focus entirely on defeating your opponents instead of struggling against lag. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2012510/extras/EA_Campaign_30_616x225.gif?t=1746726495\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore a Post-Apocalyptic Science Fantasy Universe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Stormgate\u2019s</i> story-driven Campaign drops players into the role of mighty Heroes fighting for the fate of the world. The free Vanguard prologue chapter includes three playable missions, with more campaign chapters available for purchase and new chapters to be released several times a year.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2012510/extras/MeteorStrike_30_616x225.gif?t=1746726495\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay Evolved</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flex your skills with an enhanced interface designed for both depth and approachability. With streamlined inputs and automatic control groups, it\u2019s easier than ever before to just have fun while leaving the skill ceiling sky-high for those who want to push themselves to their limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2012510/extras/EA_BaseBuilding_30_616x225.gif?t=1746726495\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unleash Your Creativity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set to debut during Early Access, the Editor empowers you to craft your own game experiences with the most advanced yet user-friendly RTS toolset available. Integrated seamlessly within the <i>Stormgate</i> client, it allows for swift iteration and polish of your maps, mods, and custom games. Sculpt intricate terrain, customize units, and then share your creations with the community. With the Editor, ignite your imagination and bring your unique visions to life\u2013you\u2019re invited to redefine the boundaries of RTS gameplay.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2012510?t=1746726495","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2012510/92c983ce753982613f6cfee8ddf1af2fdee3366e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746726495","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2012510/2fbf983a46cfe954caa006fbf0ea0934f608873a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746726495","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2012510/2fbf983a46cfe954caa006fbf0ea0934f608873a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746726495","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2012510/extras/Vanguard_Featured_30_616x225_V4.gif?t=1746726495\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plunge into the heart of battle as the ultimate battlefield commander fighting for survival in a science fantasy universe, where Earth\u2019s fate hangs on the edge of oblivion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Human defenders and their faithful robot allies stand defiant against two warring alien factions: a race of warlike demonic invaders and their technologically advanced angelic rivals. Together, these three are locked in a relentless struggle for dominance. <i>Stormgate </i>puts you\u00a0 in command of futuristic armies in  epic real-time strategy battles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2012510/extras/EA_ArmiesCollide_fixed_30_616x225.gif?t=1746726495\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fight for the Future</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the ultimate test of strategic warfare with three highly-asymmetric factions: the stalwart Human Vanguard, the relentless Infernal Host, or the highly-advanced Celestial Armada. Team up with friends and command legendary Heroes to conquer the challenging AI in co-op mode, or test your mettle on the global stage in a hero-free competitive ranked ladder focused purely on player skill. Get ready for an innovative 3v3 mode, currently in development, with a no-elimination policy to ensure you always taste victory or defeat together, as a unified team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2012510/extras/EA_MalocUltimate_30_616x225.gif?t=1746726495\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Next Generation RTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Stormgate</i> takes RTS gaming to new heights by harnessing the power of Unreal Engine 5, supercharged by our proprietary SnowPlay technology. This combination delivers an unparalleled responsive RTS gameplay experience. Our use of globally distributed servers aims to connect players from around the world, supported by advanced Rollback technology for silky smooth and stutter-free gameplay. This combination of cutting-edge technology and ultra-modern infrastructure mean you can focus entirely on defeating your opponents instead of struggling against lag. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2012510/extras/EA_Campaign_30_616x225.gif?t=1746726495\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore a Post-Apocalyptic Science Fantasy Universe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Stormgate\u2019s</i> story-driven Campaign drops players into the role of mighty Heroes fighting for the fate of the world. The free Vanguard prologue chapter includes three playable missions, with more campaign chapters available for purchase and new chapters to be released several times a year.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2012510/extras/MeteorStrike_30_616x225.gif?t=1746726495\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay Evolved</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flex your skills with an enhanced interface designed for both depth and approachability. With streamlined inputs and automatic control groups, it\u2019s easier than ever before to just have fun while leaving the skill ceiling sky-high for those who want to push themselves to their limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2012510/extras/EA_BaseBuilding_30_616x225.gif?t=1746726495\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unleash Your Creativity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set to debut during Early Access, the Editor empowers you to craft your own game experiences with the most advanced yet user-friendly RTS toolset available. Integrated seamlessly within the <i>Stormgate</i> client, it allows for swift iteration and polish of your maps, mods, and custom games. Sculpt intricate terrain, customize units, and then share your creations with the community. With the Editor, ignite your imagination and bring your unique visions to life\u2013you\u2019re invited to redefine the boundaries of RTS gameplay.</p>","developers":["Frost Giant Studios"],"dlc":[2804060,2804070,2804080],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2012510/header.jpg?t=1746726495","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a92020-2025 Frost Giant Studios, Inc. All rights reserved. Stormgate\u00ae and Frost Giant Studios are trademarks or registered trademarks of Frost Giant Studios, Inc. in the U.S. and/or other countries.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257128901,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128901/movie480.mp4?t=1745262984","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128901/movie_max.mp4?t=1745262984"},"name":"8 Months of Stormgate Development Progress","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257128901/31ad95bd0a46d1425e50cd82ce59ad4ec1101fa4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745262984","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128901/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745262984","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128901/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745262984"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257130477,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130477/movie480.mp4?t=1745526726","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130477/movie_max.mp4?t=1745526726"},"name":"Stormgate 0.4 Dev Diary Early Access","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.